{"seq":17,"trial_id":"matrix-mu-2026-11/claude-code-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T07:58:44.774Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3e0896198ff7cc349602eed81e457941f680bbed8f4a095c23b97c6e651e452f","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DMATRIX0001","text":"Hi Pree, here are the Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers I found:\n\n• *#4409*: from Moss's digest \"Central handoffs next week\" (teams/team-central/digests, 2 Jan 2026). It's a recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake).\n• *#4412*: same Moss digest. A minor glitch in the driver SMS prompt when combine trailers are staged on unpaved overflow lots.\n• *PD-5302*: from #central-random, where Hollis posted on 14 Oct that it's one more Marrow Fieldworks ticket, for a follow-up from this week.\n\nNot sure about this one:\n• *#8841*: from #central-random on 13 Oct. Tobias flagged West yard Door 2 at the Plains depots double-booking. He calls it \"Tobias's dealer account\" and never names Marrow Fieldworks, so I can't tell if it's the same account. Worth checking with Tobias.\n\nNot Marrow Fieldworks, in case these come up:\n• PD-4821 (#central-team, June 2026) and FR-882 (the Moss digest) are both *Marrow Agrisupply*, which is a separate account.\n• #88412 is Tansleigh Packaging.\n\nMoss's other Central note, the cheat sheet, has no ticket numbers. #central-team has no messages this week. Nothing else turned up for this week."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DMATRIX0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
